ica, go-go, música haitiana, salsa, la sintonía de Mi bella genio o «Mary, Mary» de los Monkees. De la Zulu Nation salieron los Jazzy Five y la Soulsonic Force; en los ochenta la Universal Zulu Nation llevó el hip hop por el mundo, de Japón a Sudáfrica, y le añadió un quinto elemento: el conocimiento.","color":"#facc15","family":"Old school: DJs, MCs y fiestas del Bronx","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/ComeUp/#zulu-nation"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":54607811541101,"artist":"Hugo Montenegro","artist_id":138219899379990,"title":"I Dream of Jeannie","year":1965,"ess":0,"yt":"oNKhAPE0LE8","kind":null,"book":{"id":2,"title":"The Come Up: An Oral History of the Rise of Hip-Hop","author":"Jonathan Abrams","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/ComeUp/"},"scene":"Afrika Bambaataa y la Zulu Nation","scene_id":158574745144669,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/ComeUp/#zulu-nation","chapters":["Cap. 1: Lemonade from Lemons"],"pages":[]}],"mentions":[],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":230520423939683,"type":"album","name":"Boogie Woogie + Bongos","list_id":75073130192498,"list":"RYM Top — Blues — Boogie Woogie","src":"musthear","rank":76,"year":1960,"note":null,"yt":"y7zGmY5UjD4","scaruffi":null},{"id":108530231368740,"type":"album","name":"Cha Chas for Dancing","list_id":183919586122243,"list":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Chachachá","src":"musthear","rank":103,"year":1960,"note":null,"yt":"0iBSGvKQPzo","scaruffi":null},{"id":203893861688015,"type":"song","name":"The Good, the Bad and the Ugly","work_year":1968,"list_id":69206598009354,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1968","src":"singles","rank":8,"year":1968,"note":"","yt":"qd_7Bnxblo4","scaruffi":null},{"id":203893861688015,"type":"song","name":"The Good, the Bad and the Ugly","work_year":1968,"list_id":132335824845498,"list":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"charts","rank":8,"year":1968,"note":null,"yt":"qd_7Bnxblo4","scaruffi":null},{"id":184999686407782,"type":"album","name":"Music From \"The